{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳瀅早前遠赴度假勝地馬爾代夫旅遊，充實充電。連日來大派福利的她意猶未盡，再度於社交平台上載了一段集結今次行程精彩瞬間的短片，紀錄下這趟令人羨慕的夢幻之旅。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳瀅為這段精華影片配文寫道：「floating between turquoise dreams and golden sunsets 💖」（漂浮於碧藍夢境與金色夕陽之間）。影片中，可見她從木棧道躍入清澈見底的碧藍「玻璃海」中暢泳，隨後又在椰林樹下的白沙灘上悠閒漫步，完美融入當地的自然美景之中。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"ee31ec1a-047b-473f-85aa-119a4792fd77.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026Abyo9QtXAw1785399691.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ee31ec1a-047b-473f-85aa-119a4792fd77.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"8cc4fa54-a89c-4e43-af8e-c613a568de2d.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026jtGo7NHCoR1785399697.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8cc4fa54-a89c-4e43-af8e-c613a568de2d.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"8b66bc65-be4c-470f-a86c-0a9eb9e99e29.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20262Ea5MJmq4E1785399703.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8b66bc65-be4c-470f-a86c-0a9eb9e99e29.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今次馬爾代夫之行，陳瀅準備十分充足。從影片中可見，她換上了多套不同風格的水着與海邊穿搭，毫不吝嗇地大騷勻稱身段，健康美十足。當中的亮眼穿搭包括：白色比<span>堅</span>尼、印花圖案比<span>堅</span>尼、簡約背心長裙、防曬潛水衣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-02T14:54:57.466377+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}